ument is < 1 for points of the ball), or eps must be stated as a fixed numeric constant of the contract - an unspecified eps silently flattens the gradient exactly on the large-distance pairs."], "tests": [{"finding": "continuous_surface: Mobius sum has the x (+)c y sign instead of (-x) (+)c y, so D(x,x) != 0, antipodal points give 0, and the c->0 limit is 2||x+y|| instead of 2||x-y||", "eval_id": "T1_surface_mobius_sign", "code": "import math
